WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.583
<b>Here Krishna says,</b>

2
00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:42.458
<b>what is day for others appears as night to </b>
<b>a person of steady wisdom, to a yogi.</b>

3
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.750
<b>And what everyone considers night,</b>

4
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.666
<b>becomes like day for a yogi.</b>

5
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:52.166
<b>Don't take this literally</b>

6
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:56.375
<b>– we must understand the deeper</b>
<b>meaning of day and night here.</b>

7
00:01:01.291 --> 00:01:02.541
<b>In this verse,</b>

8
00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:07.208
<b>day and night represent different </b>
<b>perspectives on life.</b>

9
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:09.250
<b>For those immersed in materialism,</b>

10
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:14.583
<b>whose goals are worldly possessions </b>
<b>and desires, this is their day. </b>

11
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:18.875
<b>But for a yogi absorbed in spirituality, </b>
<b>this same realm appears as night</b>

12
00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:21.833
<b>– they remain detached from these pursuits.</b>

13
00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:27.333
<b>For such a yogi, spiritual progress </b>
<b>and union with the Divine is the only goal</b>

14
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:29.083
<b>– this is their day.</b>

15
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.250
<b>Meanwhile,</b>

16
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.833
<b>those absorbed in materialism</b>
<b>have no interest in this realm;</b>

17
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:41.416
<b>they keep their eyes closed to spirituality, </b>
<b>as if sleeping through the night.</b>

18
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:42.458
<b>Materialism</b>

19
00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:43.958
<b>and spirituality</b>

20
00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:49.000
<b>– two perspectives of wisdom, </b>
<b>where one's day is another's night.</b>

21
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.791
<b>But</b>

22
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:52.125
<b>here's the profound truth to consider:</b>

23
00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:57.125
<b>among all species in this world, </b>
<b>among countless forms of life,</b>

24
00:01:57.125 --> 00:02:04.708
<b>only humans have been blessed with </b>
<b>the capacity to discover their spiritual nature.</b>

25
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.958
<b>This gift isn't available to any other living being.</b>

26
00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:10.791
<b>Now the choice lies with humans</b>

27
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:13.666
<b>– whether they will utilize this divine gift,</b>

28
00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:17.083
<b>or let it go to waste.</b>

29
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:29.916
<b>While those immersed in materialism </b>
<b>focus on worldly attachments,</b>

30
00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:35.833
<b>a spiritual person aims for the soul's growth.</b>

31
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.750
<b>Day and night,</b>

32
00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:40.333
<b>spirituality and materialism</b>

33
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:43.208
<b>– two contrasting perspectives.</b>

34
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:48.875
<b>Understand this difference in </b>
<b>perspective within life's context.</b>

35
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:53.333
<b>Know the power of right perspective.</b>

36
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:58.166
<b>Often, we compare ourselves with others.</b>

37
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:02.375
<b>This becomes the root of envy.</b>

38
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:05.750
<b>Someone has more wealth than you,</b>

39
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.416
<b>a higher position,</b>

40
00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:10.875
<b>more fame.</b>

41
00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:13.375
<b>This is one perspective.</b>

42
00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:14.833
<b>Constant comparison,</b>

43
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:17.875
<b>which gives birth to jealousy.</b>

44
00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:21.625
<b>Now see it from another perspective:</b>

45
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.125
<b>Are those you compare</b>

46
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:30.625
<b>yourself with at the absolute peak of wealth, </b>
<b>position, and fame?</b>

47
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:32.125
<b>No.</b>

48
00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:33.125
<b>Similarly,</b>

49
00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:40.250
<b>in terms of wealth, position, and fame, </b>
<b>are you at the absolute bottom?</b>

50
00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:45.166
<b>The answer is certainly no.</b>

51
00:03:45.166 --> 00:03:47.708
<b>Just as you're ahead of some,</b>

52
00:03:47.708 --> 00:03:50.041
<b>others are ahead of you.</b>

53
00:03:50.041 --> 00:03:53.041
<b>Everyone has their own place,</b>

54
00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:55.375
<b>their own journey,</b>

55
00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:58.708
<b>their own life.</b>

56
00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:08.291
<b>How futile it is that someone envies you, </b>
<b>while you envy another.</b>

57
00:04:08.291 --> 00:04:14.291
<b>Materialism only breeds such unnecessary </b>
<b>thoughts, leading you astray.</b>

58
00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:18.375
<b>Wasting time in comparisons.</b>

59
00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:22.541
<b>If you could salvage this wasted time,</b>

60
00:04:22.541 --> 00:04:29.708
<b>save the energy spent in envy, </b>
<b>and invest it purely in your efforts</b>

61
00:04:29.708 --> 00:04:34.000
<b>– moving forward without comparison</b>

62
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.791
<b>– you will surely achieve your goals.</b>

63
00:04:38.791 --> 00:04:41.125
<b>How peaceful this would be.</b>

64
00:04:41.125 --> 00:04:42.958
<b>Two perspectives.</b>

65
00:04:42.958 --> 00:04:46.416
<b>The choice between them is yours.</b>

66
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:52.416
<b>In society,</b>

67
00:04:52.416 --> 00:04:54.500
<b>in the world,</b>

68
00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.166
<b>there are two kinds of people.</b>

69
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:58.166
<b>Those</b>

70
00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:00.833
<b>interested in spirituality,</b>

71
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:08.541
<b>and those who aren't, living material lives.</b>

72
00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:15.916
<b>Their lifestyles, priorities, and purposes will differ.</b>

73
00:05:15.916 --> 00:05:20.208
<b>When people of opposing </b>
<b>ideologies come together,</b>

74
00:05:20.208 --> 00:05:24.791
<b>disagreements on various issues are natural, </b>

75
00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:27.708
<b>tensions may arise.</b>

76
00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:34.791
<b>But in a social environment, </b>
<b>interaction and dialogue will happen.</b>

77
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:37.750
<b>One cannot remain distant.</b>

78
00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:42.291
<b>Harmony and mutual respect are essential.</b>

79
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:48.041
<b>For this, it's important not to </b>
<b>view it as right versus wrong,</b>

80
00:05:48.041 --> 00:05:56.583
<b>but try to understand that everyone</b>
<b>has their own life, their own journey.</b>

81
00:05:56.583 --> 00:06:02.125
<b>Continue forward while respecting </b>
<b>everyone's spiritual level.</b>

82
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:05.208
<b>Vigilance is necessary here</b>

83
00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:07.458
<b>– your journey is right,</b>

84
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:10.958
<b>this perspective is correct.</b>

85
00:06:10.958 --> 00:06:15.625
<b>But if you make it a basis for argument,</b>

86
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:19.208
<b>get entangled in debates of right and wrong,</b>

87
00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:25.333
<b>it means you're straying from the spiritual path.</b>

88
00:06:25.333 --> 00:06:29.333
<b>Walking the right path is important;</b>

89
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:35.458
<b>proving it right to everyone isn't necessary.</b>

90
00:06:35.458 --> 00:06:37.166
<b>Reflect on this.</b>

91
00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:48.333
<b>There are two ways to understand</b>
<b>this world and conduct life.</b>

92
00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:53.958
<b>One through spiritual perspective </b>
<b>and one through material perspective.</b>

93
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:56.500
<b>Both will have different thoughts,</b>

94
00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:05.625
<b>working methods, different ways </b>
<b>of viewing and solving problems.</b>

95
00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:11.791
<b>Understanding this difference </b>
<b>and respectfully accepting it</b>

96
00:07:11.791 --> 00:07:17.666
<b>is crucial for a healthy professional environment.</b>

97
00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:23.041
<b>Someone's opposite thinking</b>
<b>or different working style</b>

98
00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:29.125
<b>cannot become a basis for hatred or dislike.</b>

99
00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:31.666
<b>This would be inappropriate.</b>

100
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:34.875
<b>See everyone as a form of the soul.</b>

101
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:39.958
<b>If you can help someone in right actions, do so;</b>

102
00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:43.958
<b>if you can take help, take it.</b>

103
00:07:43.958 --> 00:07:48.041
<b>Keep your focus on the goal</b>

104
00:07:48.041 --> 00:07:51.833
<b>and continue working with</b>
<b>a spiritual perspective.</b>

